#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0659 expect=executionError domain=ADNCA
#expect-execution-error "PKSUMXFN is declared Char"
#note "R7 (PLAN-column-type-conformance): PKSUMXFN shipped as Char is nonconformant data (ADNCA v1.0 declares it Num). The comparison PKSUMXFN != 1 puts a character column against a numeric literal, so per R4 the engine must ERROR instead of silently text-comparing. This fixture is the shape the pre-gate invalid scenario shipped: the gate turned that silent text compare into the error pinned here."
dataset ADNCA
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PKSUMXFN type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col NFRLT type=Num
col AFRLT type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 2 | CONC | 0 | 0.5
---
